    "handle": "jasper-wildfire-anniversary-collection",
    "title": "Jasper Wildfire Anniversary Collection",
    "collection_url": "https://locallaundry.ca//collections/jasper-wildfire-anniversary-collection",
    "description": "<p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"613\">In the summer of 2024, Jasper faced one of the most devastating wildfires in its history. Entire landscapes changed. Lives were disrupted. And yet, a powerful wave of support rose from across the country.</p>\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"799\">Now, one year later, we’re launching the <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"698\">Jasper Wildfire Anniversary Collection</strong>, a limited-edition line of t-shirts and crewnecks that give back to the community.</p>\n<p data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"301\">We’re donating <strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"93\"><strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"213\">$10 from every T-shirt</strong> and <strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"245\">$20 from every crewneck</strong> to the <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"275\">Canadian Red Cross.</strong></strong></p>\n<h3 data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"301\">\n<strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"93\"><strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"275\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"78\">Missed the Pre-Sale?</strong><br data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"81\"></strong></strong>We’ve added a few extra units.</h3>\n<p data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"301\">If you see your size in stock, you can still grab one! Just make sure to check the estimated shipping time before ordering.</p>",
    "products_count": 3,
    "published_at": "2025-07-18T10:10:29-06:00",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-27T05:01:49-07:00"
  },
