    "collection_url": "https://locallaundry.ca//collections/shackets",
    "description": "<p>Discover the Bow River Shacket Collection, crafted for unparalleled warmth and comfort with premium cotton fleece. Perfect for every season, from spring strolls to winter layering, this versatile piece embodies Canadian-made quality and design. Inspired by the rugged beauty of the Bow River in the Rockies, it balances durability with classic style.</p>\n<p>Constructed with flatlock seams and a sturdy, fused collar, this shacket promises enduring wear. Details like sophisticated gunmetal buttons and dual front pockets add functional elegance. The longer back hem and oversized, unisex fit make it ideal for layering over any outfit.</p>\n<p>Cut and sewn in Canada, the Bow River Shacket is not just a stylish wardrobe staple but a sustainable choice that supports eco-conscious fashion.</p>",
