    "title": "The CAN Collection",
    "collection_url": "https://locallaundry.ca//collections/canada-collection",
    "description": "<p>The CAN collection, featuring our own Trademarked CAN logo created in 2016 to showcase the pride we all have as Canadian's. Unlike most Canadian branded clothing, this collection, like all Local Laundry garments, is entirely made in Canada. Our t-shirts, sweaters, hats, and even our socks and pillows are manufactured right here on Canadian soil - dyed, milled, cut, sewn, decorated, and finished. What's more Canadian than really supporting one another through local manufacturing.</p>\n<p>We've recently partnered with the Canadian Sports Institute of Calgary to offer registered athletes 25% off Local Laundry products. Canadian athletes can now proudly wear the maple leaf in the form of Canadian-made gear. If you are a registered athlete with CSI Calgary, contact them for more information.<br></p>\n<p> </p>",
