    "handle": "the-yyc-collection",
    "title": "The YYC Collection",
    "collection_url": "https://locallaundry.ca//collections/the-yyc-collection",
    "description": "<p>What does YYC mean? <br><br>We get this question a fair bit as we continue to grow our small brand with big dreams outside of Calgary and Canada. If you're from Calgary, it's pretty simple. What started as simply an airport code, quickly grew to the identity if our city. Call it a slang, or a nickname, but Calgarians are a proud bunch and have always been proud to showcase their love for YYC. Since inception in 2015, this (now trademarked) design was what started it all. <br></p>\n<p>To pay homage to that, and to our absolute love for our city, we continue to grow and evolve our YYC collection. Whether you're from Calgary or not, the design is timeless and you can feel proud knowing your supporting not just a conscious brand, but an entire community.</p>",
    "products_count": 45,
