    "description": "<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"167\"><strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"167\">Toronto Maple Leafs Baseball Club Collection</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"444\">We’ve teamed up with the <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"231\">Toronto Maple Leafs Baseball Club</strong>, one of the longest-running baseball teams in Canada, to create a limited run of licensed gear. The team plays in the Intercounty Baseball League and carries on a proud Toronto sports legacy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"516\">This drop includes a licensed quarter-zip and tee, both made in Canada.</p>",
